    ["<Red>脆弱</>：庇护效果结束时，纸人所承受溢出伤害的15%会重新作用到主人身上，并使主人在接下来的15秒内，减伤降低15%。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Fragile</>: When the protection effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage absorbed by the paper figurine is reapplied to the master, and the master's Damage Reduction is lowered by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Yellow>生命能量</>：携带者每隔<Yellow>20秒</>获得1点生命能量，持有上限为3点。携带者对自身或友方单位造成的累计有效治疗超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>50%</>时，消耗1点生命能量，对目标附加3层<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>效果，持续10秒，并获得1枚<Yellow>生命之种</>，持有上限为3枚。\n\n<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>：生命值不满时，每秒消耗1层，恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</>点生命值。\n<Yellow>生命之种</>：携带者受到伤害时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则自动消耗1枚生命之种，固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。\n身处主宰争锋玩法中时，生命手杖效果降低。"] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The wearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the wearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the wearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds.\n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consumes 1 stack per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP.\n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the wearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP. The effect of the Life Staff is reduced while in the Dominator's Clash mode.",
